msgstr "%s Zeile(n) erneut durchsucht."

#. module: account_statement_matcher
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_statement_matcher.field_account_statement_match_candidate__score
msgid ""
"100 a document reference was found in the bank text, 80 partner and amount "
"match, 60 the amount identifies a single open item, 30 partner only."
msgstr ""
"100 Belegnummer im Banktext gefunden, 80 Partner und Betrag stimmen, 60 der "
"Betrag bestimmt genau einen offenen Posten, 30 nur der Partner."

#. module: account_statement_matcher
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_statement_matcher.view_statement_line_matcher_form
msgid ""
"<span invisible=\"matcher_state != 'rule'\"> matches this line and books it on\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <span invisible=\"matcher_state == 'rule'\"> booked this line on\n"
"                        </span>"
msgstr ""
"<span invisible=\"matcher_state != 'rule'\"> passt auf diese Zeile und bucht sie auf\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <span invisible=\"matcher_state == 'rule'\"> hat diese Zeile gebucht auf\n"
"                        </span>"

#. module: account_statement_matcher
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_statement_matcher.view_statement_line_matcher_form
msgid ""
"A line that finds nothing today can be searched again later:\n"
"                        vendor bills, credit notes and down payments entered\n"
"                        afterwards are picked up by \"Search again\"."
msgstr ""
"Eine Zeile ohne Treffer kann später erneut durchsucht werden:\n"
